{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"hey, so I have a couple of scenarios I'd like to run by the DMs re: City magic tax\n\npersona dramatis: GOO, great old one warlock. relevant abilities: Awakened Mind, which does not require the subject of telepathy to share a language with the GOO; Pact of the Chain, so familiar is an imp, which can speak; Voice of the Chain Master, able to telepathically speak with familiar across the entire plane. No cantrips which are touch spells, so familiar knows/can use no cantrips.\n\nscenario 1: GOO would like to talk to someone in the City. However, said someone (let's call them M) is not comfortable with people using telepathy. As such, Awakened Mind is out. However, having the familiar relay messages (speaking in Common using their own voice, not use-familiar's-senses), should work.\n\nscenario 2: a friend of GOO (who also has cantrips) would also like to talk with M. GOO sends familiar to M, and stays in a different borough with friend. Familiar relays as before, but GOO - being out of the borough - is either:\n- able to speak Common normally, and relays as such to the friend\n- unable to speak Common normally due to the link with familiar in the City, but able to use Awakened Mind to relay to friend, as not requiring a shared language implies some degree of psychic translation and as such talking to friend in Deep Speech via Awakened Mind would still be understood.\n\n(I'm fully aware these are Shenanigans and - while, according to how I interpret the rules, they would be legit - may well get shot down by those of more knowledge. I'm just being extra dramatic about it so if they do get shot down you at least get a laugh out of it :v)","created_at":"2021-07-17T13:15:41.977000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865944855284940810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"(I would definitely like to know the rules re: familiar communication in City, though - personally I would say familiar talking for themselves is fine, but obviously I'm not in charge here)","created_at":"2021-07-17T13:17:32.467000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865945318712934410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"> Starting at 1st level, your alien knowledge gives you the ability to touch the minds of other creatures. You can telepathically speak to any creature you can see within 30 feet of you. **You don't need to share a language with the creature for it to understand your telepathic utterances**, but the creature must be able to understand at least one language.\nemphasis is mine","created_at":"2021-07-17T13:19:08.537000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T13:19:43.197000Z","id":"865945721659850792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
